        "action_date": "2025-04-30",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><b>Police Officers Protecting Children Act</b></p> <p>This bill specifies that certain active and retired law enforcement officers who are authorized to carry concealed firearms are not subject to the federal prohibition on possessing (or discharging) a firearm in a school zone.</p>",
        "update_date": "2026-04-03T18:26:05Z"
      }
